  "notes": [
    "**Defective verb** — only regularly used in **Presente** and **Pretérito Imperfecto**; other tenses are not used in modern Spanish",
    "o→ue stem change in all present forms except *nosotros/nosotras* (solemos)",
    "Always followed by **infinitive**: *soler + infinitive* = to usually do something",
    "*Suelo levantarme a las 7* — I usually get up at 7",
    "*Solíamos ir a la playa* — We used to go to the beach (imperfecto = past habit)",
    "Past participle: *solido* (rarely used)"
  ],
